 potential therapies is a really  powerful concept and so their next  stages of work are going to be focusing  on trying to deliver the cargo to  a variety of different tissues and cell  types and to also test it in animals so  doing it in fivo and so this is very  early stage work but it expands the  toolbox of ways to deliver gene and  editing therapies to cells  and so obviously without having the in  fever data it's hard to know at the  moment if it has any impact on causing  any autoimmune responses or any  inflammatory responses within the body  but it's a neat little bit of technology  so i thought i'd share with you my  understanding of it today  so yeah with that so i hope you've  learned something in this video and  thank you to my patreon supporters and  thank you for listening
 

